Version 0.1.1 - 2026-02-23

Changes
- Added stop-loss hedge mode support using `SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_MODE=HEDGE`.
- Added compatibility alias `SNIPER_STOP_LESS_MODE` for stop-loss mode lookup.
- Simplified runtime config flow so stop-loss hedge can be enabled with one mode flag.
- Updated `stable.env` to use `SNIPER_STOP_LOSS_MODE=HEDGE`.

Implementation Notes
- Stop-loss hedge trigger is wired in sniper exit logic (`src/bot.rs`), with behavior selected by stop-loss mode.
- Build/version string automatically reflects the crate version via `CARGO_PKG_VERSION`.
